skip: ## The brief contract — refuse an incomplete brief, ask about a vague one
text: ## Input — a dispatch token, never a brief
text:
text: This prompt is the external mode of `workbench-dev-team:watson`. It takes
text: only the machine-built token `External issue: <owner/repo#n>`, never a
text: six-slot brief. If your prompt carries no such token, it reached the wrong
text: type: change nothing, and report that `workbench-dev-team:watson` takes the
text: brief.
section: ## Working-context budget — roughly 250k tokens, self-checked
